  "nl_text": "The rschema_0086 database contains seven tables, each representing a different entity or relationship in the system. The Material table stores information about the materials used in the procurement process, including their description, ID, name, type, and unit. The Region table contains information about the regions in which the companies are located, including their ID and name. The Country table stores information about the countries in which the companies are located, including their code, ID, name, and tax ID. The Procurement_Application table contains information about the procurement applications, including the quantity, time, material ID, ID, remarks, and foreign key references to the Material table. The Supplier table contains information about the suppliers, including their address, country ID, fax, name, phone, region ID, ID, tax ID, and foreign key references to the Country and Region tables. The Company table contains information about the companies, including their activation time, address, ID, country ID, creation time, ERP system identifier, email, name, password, phone, region ID, security answer, security question, status, tax ID, update time, username, VAT registration number, and foreign key references to the Country and Region tables. The Supplier_Production_Material table contains information about the materials produced by the suppliers, including the material ID, production quantity, production time, remarks, and foreign key references to the Material and Supplier tables.",
  "gold_question": "Supply Chain Management System\nThe main function of the supply chain management system is to manage procurement, material supply, and production processes between suppliers and companies. The system supports the input of supplier and company information, material management, procurement application handling, and records detailed data for each material production. The specific business description is as follows:\n\nSupplier Management:\nThe system can manage the basic information of multiple suppliers, including supplier name, address, phone number, fax number, tax ID, etc. Each supplier is categorized based on the region and country they are located in, ensuring that the supplier’s geographical and business background is clearly identified.\nThe system also records information about the materials produced by suppliers, including material type, production time, production quantity, etc., helping the company understand the production capacity and material supply situation of each supplier.\n\nCompany Management:\nThe system supports recording company information, including company name, address, phone number, email, tax ID, ERP system identifier, etc. The management of company information ensures that procurement and supply chain operations are carried out according to company standards and supports management of companies in different regions and countries.\nThe company can also manage procurement applications through the system, ensuring that the types, quantities, and delivery times of requested materials meet the company’s production planning needs.\n\nMaterial Management:\nThe system can manage basic information about all materials, including material type, name, description, unit, etc. The management of material information helps the company clearly understand the specifications, usage, and inventory levels of each material.\nThe relationships between materials and suppliers will also be established in the system to track materials produced by different suppliers and their production quantities.\n\nProcurement Application Management:\nThe system can record internal procurement applications within the company, including material ID, application time, application quantity, remarks, etc., ensuring the rationality of each material request and enabling effective tracking of the procurement process.\nThe procurement application form is linked with material information, allowing timely adjustments in procurement when demand increases or production plans change, ensuring that production does not halt due to material shortages.\n\nRegion and Country Management:\nThe system supports management of different regions and countries, including region names and country codes and names. Through this information, the system can manage the distribution of suppliers, companies, and materials based on geographical location, improving the optimization ability of the supply chain.\nIn summary, this supply chain management system helps the company manage the entire procurement and material supply process by recording data on suppliers, materials, procurement applications, and more, optimizing supply chain operations and ensuring that each material procurement and production process is efficient and traceable.",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_codellama13b/0086.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0086\nCREATE TABLE `material` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `type` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n  `unit` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `region` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `country` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `code` char(3) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `tax_id` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `procurement_application` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `material_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `quantity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `remarks` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `procurement_application_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`material_id`) REFERENCES `material` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `supplier` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `fax` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `country_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `region_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `tax_id` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `supplier_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`country_id`) REFERENCES `country` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `supplier_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`region_id`) REFERENCES `region` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `company` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `username` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `tax_id` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `vat_registration_number` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `country_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `region_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `activation_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `creation_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `update_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `security_question` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `security_answer` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `status` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `erp_system_identifier` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `company_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`country_id`) REFERENCES `country` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `company_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`region_id`) REFERENCES `region` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `supplier_production_material` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `supplier_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `material_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `production_quantity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `production_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `remarks` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `supplier_production_material_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`supplier_id`) REFERENCES `supplier` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `supplier_production_material_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`material_id`) REFERENCES `material` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
